    "Durable UNIQUE bet/original/refund links established inside the newly funded atomic purchase, with immutable original terms and journal fingerprints",
    "Wallet-first locked cancellation revalidates current owner, bet/item, ticket, draw/cutoff, original debit, currency and shared risk ownership",
