    "Managed original/refund generic reversal blocking survives removed polymorphic labels",
    "Existing authenticated HTTP endpoint returns safe redacted 422 for risk/financial refusals; no public permission or route is added",
    "Commission history is explicitly refused pending a coordinated member-and-agent workflow; no silent retained commission after member refund",
    "No historical ownership backfill, timeout release or nonempty-history ordinary downgrade"
